{"excerpt_id":"ex_ae13d4956c22_033","source_id":"src_ae13d4956c22","source_hash":"7ab64f397da1aceda8cf20001e10e8add2f1183f8af29ccd1499b8798de89a6e","text":"Self-study, using the syllabus and recommended reading material, is also an option when preparing for the Foundation Level exam.","location_hint":"paragraph 83","char_start":5510,"char_end":5638,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T01:23:02.046Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ae13d4956c22_034","source_id":"src_ae13d4956c22","source_hash":"7ab64f397da1aceda8cf20001e10e8add2f1183f8af29ccd1499b8798de89a6e","text":"Holders of this certification will be eligible to proceed to the next stage of the Core stream and take Test Analyst, Technical Test Analyst, or Test Management Advanced Level certifications. They may also choose to follow the Agile or Specialist streams to develop specific skills.","location_hint":"paragraph 84","char_start":5640,"char_end":5922,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-08T01:23:02.046Z"}
